WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.470
Brad: I never thought mixing colors could be so important.

2
00:00:15.471 --> 00:00:19.104
Danny: Well, you learn something new every day!

3
00:00:19.105 --> 00:00:24.538
Tina: It’s a good thing we paid attention in art class.

4
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:26.768
Brad: We should get on with our mission.

5
00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:30.181
Tina: Yes, there is still a lot to do.

6
00:00:30.182 --> 00:00:36.584
Danny: Wait! Do you see what I see?

7
00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:38.314
Bello: Bug.

8
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:41.303
Tina: It looks like Hopian’s messenger bug.

9
00:00:41.304 --> 00:00:43.748
Brad: But this bug is all gray.

10
00:00:43.749 --> 00:00:47.629
Danny: Maybe the bug was captured by Tristay!

11
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.565
Tina: Or maybe Hopian sent it.

12
00:00:50.566 --> 00:00:56.895
Tina: Maybe he made it gray so that Tristay wouldn’t notice it.

13
00:00:56.896 --> 00:00:59.726
Tina: It’s drawing Hopian’s face!

14
00:00:59.727 --> 00:01:01.381
Bello: Dada!

15
00:01:01.382 --> 00:01:05.820
Danny: Wait. There’s more.

16
00:01:05.821 --> 00:01:09.580
Brad: That looks like a television set.

17
00:01:09.581 --> 00:01:12.112
Tina: What does it mean?

18
00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:17.264
Brad: Look. The bug is going into the house.

19
00:01:17.265 --> 00:01:21.512
Danny: Maybe Hopian is home again!

20
00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:38.941
All three: Hopian! Hopian, are you here?

21
00:01:38.942 --> 00:01:43.741
Danny: Maybe we’re supposed to watch television until Hopian arrives.

22
00:01:43.742 --> 00:01:48.769
Brad: Maybe we’re supposed to turn on the television to see Hopian!

23
00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.827
Tina: I think you’re right!

24
00:01:50.828 --> 00:01:54.045
Danny: Let’s watch!

25
00:01:54.046 --> 00:02:04.281
Brad: Okay, but you’ll have to help me turn it on.

26
00:02:04.282 --> 00:02:06.107
Tina: Oh no!

27
00:02:06.108 --> 00:02:08.119
Bello: Dada hurt?

28
00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:13.707
Tina: It’s just a television show, Bello.

29
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.791
Brad: Is this our fault?

30
00:02:15.792 --> 00:02:19.617
Danny: No. We didn’t do this. Tristay did.

31
00:02:19.618 --> 00:02:23.513
Brad: But if we hadn’t come here, Hopian wouldn’t be in trouble.

32
00:02:23.514 --> 00:02:26.908
Brad: And Hopian would be here right now.

33
00:02:26.909 --> 00:02:30.030
Hopian: Danny, Tina, Brad.

34
00:02:30.031 --> 00:02:32.750
Tina: Hopian, are you all right?

35
00:02:32.751 --> 00:02:35.282
Danny: Don’t let Tristay hurt you!

36
00:02:35.283 --> 00:02:38.260
Hopian: Calm down. I’m fine.

37
00:02:38.261 --> 00:02:46.681
Hopian: Tristay will let me go and won't harm [n3@Bello if you return to your world.

38
00:02:46.682 --> 00:02:49.443
Brad: But we don’t know how to get back.

39
00:02:49.444 --> 00:02:54.420
Hopian: Tristay has prepared a magic door that will take you back home.

40
00:02:54.421 --> 00:02:57.665
Hopian: The gray bug will lead you to it.

41
00:02:57.666 --> 00:03:00.338
Tina: Hopian, are you sure?

42
00:03:00.339 --> 00:03:07.221
Hopian: Good-bye, children. Thank you for your help.

43
00:03:07.222 --> 00:03:09.258
Danny: I think it’s a trap.

44
00:03:09.259 --> 00:03:11.770
Tristay is trying to trick us.

45
00:03:11.771 --> 00:03:14.104
Brad: But it sounded like Hopian.

46
00:03:14.105 --> 00:03:18.974
It looked like Hopian.

47
00:03:18.975 --> 00:03:21.477
Tina: He needs his father back.

48
00:03:21.478 --> 00:03:23.464
Danny: I guess so.

49
00:03:23.465 --> 00:03:27.427
Brad: And we did bring back a lot of color to Ginormous.

50
00:03:27.428 --> 00:03:29.294
Danny: Just not all of it.

51
00:03:29.295 --> 00:03:34.232
Tina: I think we have to go back home.
